WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:08.694
"Watch this!"

2
00:00:08.695 --> 00:00:12.325
Cupcake started to run.

3
00:00:12.326 --> 00:00:17.552
She jumped over a spoon. "Yay!"

4
00:00:17.553 --> 00:00:25.959
Berry clapped. "Nice jump, Cupcake!"

5
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:31.161
He jumped over the spoon.

6
00:00:31.162 --> 00:00:35.982
"Woo-hoo!" Cupcake cheered.

7
00:00:35.983 --> 00:00:41.224
"Now let's jump over two spoons!"

8
00:00:41.225 --> 00:00:47.134
They got another spoon.

9
00:00:47.135 --> 00:00:52.697
Berry jumped over them.

10
00:00:52.698 --> 00:00:58.846
Then Cupcake jumped over them. "Yay!"

11
00:00:58.847 --> 00:01:03.644
Berry smiled. "This is fun!"

12
00:01:03.645 --> 00:01:16.903
"Yeah!" Cupcake said. "We're good jumpers!"

13
00:01:16.904 --> 00:01:20.025
Pickle came over.

14
00:01:20.026 --> 00:01:27.445
"I can jump farther."

15
00:01:27.446 --> 00:01:32.616
Berry rolled his eyes. "Who cares, Pickle?

16
00:01:32.617 --> 00:01:35.205
We're jumping for fun."

17
00:01:35.206 --> 00:01:42.572
"Yeah, Pickle!" Cupcake jumped again.

18
00:01:42.573 --> 00:01:48.012
"Who cares?"

19
00:01:48.013 --> 00:01:56.527
Pickle snorted. "I can jump higher too."

20
00:01:56.528 --> 00:02:02.526
Berry shrugged. "We're just having fun, Pickle.

21
00:02:02.527 --> 00:02:06.390
Right, Cupcake?"

22
00:02:06.391 --> 00:02:10.583
"Grr," Cupcake thought.

23
00:02:10.584 --> 00:02:14.367
"Pickle always has to be the best!"

24
00:02:14.368 --> 00:02:24.510
She frowned. "Um . . . yeah. Fun."

25
00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:30.546
Pickle folded his arms. "I'm the best jumper."

26
00:02:30.547 --> 00:02:36.039
Berry sighed. "Who cares?

27
00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:41.384
We're just having—"

28
00:02:41.385 --> 00:02:49.953
"I care!" Cupcake stomped her foot. "Agh!"

